message:
A fleet bearer reached the ceiling gate with NO fleetKeyId (event=fleet_ceiling.missing_key_id) — a derivation bug in the fleet branch of isAnyKnownBearer (search-bearer.ts / fleet-key-id.ts). This should never happen.

The request was allowed (loud-degrade), so there is no user impact, but the ceiling is not counting this caller. Investigate — do not just raise the ceiling.

